   feature to steer when the invariants are enforced (at method calls,
   on setting attributes, or in both situations).
 
+* Fixed invariants of a subclass leaking into the base class (#295)
+
+  The invariants of a derived class were erroneously inserted into the list
+  of invariants of its base class (and thus affected the base class as well as
+  its sibling classes). The derived class now gets its own copy of the
+  inherited invariants before adding its own ones.
+
